{{PageBanner|Gatya bnr174.png|gacha}}
The '''Platinum Capsule''' is a special type of [[Cat Capsule]] with a 100% chance for any [[:Category:Uber Rare Cats|Uber Rare]], with the exceptions of seasonals, collab units, [[Best of the Best (Gacha Event)|Best of the Best]]/[[NEO Best of the Best (Gacha Event)|NEO Best of the Best]] units and any of the [[Girls & Monsters: Angels of Terror (Gacha Event)|Girls & Monsters]] set of Uber Rares.

Despite appearing in the same menu, Platinum Capsules are their own gacha that is completely unconnected to other Rare Capsule events that may also be ongoing. Ergo, if you draw a Platinum Capsule while [[UBERFEST (Gacha Event)|UBERFEST]] is active, your odds of obtaining [[Baby Gao (Uber Rare Cat)|Baby Gao]] or other such exclusive units will not be any different from if you did the same during [[THE DYNAMITES (Gacha Event)|THE DYNAMITES]].

To enter this Gacha, the player requires a Platinum Ticket, which can be obtained by buying it with real currency via a special sale for $7.99 USD or more, exchanging 10 Platinum Shards or through various other methods that are listed below.

Introduced in [[The Battle Cats Unite!/Update History#Patch 1.0.4 (July 16, 2020)|Version 1.0.4]] of [[The Battle Cats Unite!|The Battle Cats Unite]], you can enter this gacha event by obtaining a real-life platinum ticket from a Corocoro issue and redeem the code on the backside of it.

